# state: returning   (classifier-path reopen using the kept golden profile; #433 step 6d)
# MechAssault 2: Lone Wolf (4D53006B): a `returning` variant of
# mechassault-2.route (first-run) for a disk that already has the kept
# profile/save. The profile gate refuses a repeat first-run creation (R1:
# the title already has a kept profile); this route opens with `drive
# generic` instead of the first-run's blind boot-to-mission-select sequence,
# replaying the menus with the trained classifier until play is confirmed,
# then marks. Player control is unchanged from the first-run route: fires
# (RT), sweeps the aim (RX) and walks (LY).
drive generic 300 mark
repeat forever {
    axis RT max
    wait 0.3
    axis RT min
    wait 0.5
    axis RX max
    wait 0.3
    axis RX mid
    axis RT max
    wait 0.3
    axis RT min
    wait 0.5
    axis RX min
    wait 0.3
    axis RX mid
    axis LY min
    wait 1
    axis LY mid
}
